Clawd animations in this folder (cut to 36 px GIFs, repeated frames merged):
  clawd-working.gif  thinking, from https://github.com/marciogranzotto/clawd-tank (MIT, below)
  clawd-blocked.gif  confused, from https://github.com/abderrahimghazali/clawd-pet (MIT, below), its CSS animation rendered frame by frame
  clawd-done.gif     mini-happy, from https://github.com/rullerzhou-afk/clawd-on-desk (AGPL-3.0)

